{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tokyo. On the eve of the year 2000.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The office tower of Kurobaito Systems stands empty beneath endless rain.<br>The power is still on. The computers still boot.<br>But the people are gone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You find yourself inside a building where the past seems trapped between floors.<br>Explore offices, corridors, and technical areas, gradually unlocking access to new zones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boot up old PCs, read employee records, uncover traces of presence \u2014 and piece together the chain of events that unfolded within these walls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is a sense of something else inside the building.<br>Sometimes in movement. Sometimes in sound.<br>It is not always visible \u2014 but you are not alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimalist design with a focus on atmosphere rather than action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tension built through presence and the unknown</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slow-paced exploration and gradual area progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environmental storytelling through documents and forgotten technology</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4005610?t=1766686356","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005610/14b5a6399c427abdcf300d34b8fed3cf87e83e74/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766686356","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005610/926d31b627e8738fd4ba769431e599b63a2db0c9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766686356","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005610/926d31b627e8738fd4ba769431e599b63a2db0c9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766686356","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tokyo. On the eve of the year 2000.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The office tower of Kurobaito Systems stands empty beneath endless rain.<br>The power is still on. The computers still boot.<br>But the people are gone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You find yourself inside a building where the past seems trapped between floors.<br>Explore offices, corridors, and technical areas, gradually unlocking access to new zones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boot up old PCs, read employee records, uncover traces of presence \u2014 and piece together the chain of events that unfolded within these walls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is a sense of something else inside the building.<br>Sometimes in movement. Sometimes in sound.<br>It is not always visible \u2014 but you are not alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimalist design with a focus on atmosphere rather than action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tension built through presence and the unknown</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slow-paced exploration and gradual area progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environmental storytelling through documents and forgotten technology</p></li></ul>","developers":["goenhatsu"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005610/7a96216e81ad7eb20523fb1d117e95df17395d48/header.jpg?t=1766686356","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4005610/1198773578/7f620f0fb27823b62660